        <body>
            <div xml:id="d133">

                <pb facs="0227" n="211" sameAs="frus:frus1949v02/pg211"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.A Summaries/11–1449: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The United States Representative at the United
                        Nations</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Austin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg></opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New York</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-11-14T23:30:00-05:00">November 14,
                            1949—11:30 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1342.</p>
                <p>. . . . . . .</p>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chinese Case</hi>
                </p>
                <p>After carefully reading the US-suggested resolution in the Chinese case, GA President Romulo” said that he could go along
                    with the ideas expressed therein. He thought he would like to join in sponsoring
                    such a proposal should that action become desirable, but said he would have to
                    obtain the instructions of his Government.</p>
                <p>Rau (India) promised to consider the possibilities of co-sponsorship of such a
                    proposal.</p>
                <p>. . . . . . .</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Austin</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
